    {
      "id": "u_b217598ef926cd5fbd1f5e58_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Web view on the server vs. Electron__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "b217598ef926cd5fbd1f5e5871c61119522046baee24d2a8d53f25c96d900e5b",
      "context": "Web View > Web view on the server vs. Electron",
      "contextHash": "5e92a245e53850dc979156f10ba037f83321219d4b9e9bf4d58dd00f3b3a3525",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_70fad4d455460cf75d7ae7c9_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "When accessing Trilium via a browser instead of the desktop application, the web view will still try to render the content of the desired webpage. However, since it's running in a browser there are quite a few limitations as opposed to the desktop one.",
      "sourceHash": "70fad4d455460cf75d7ae7c942c241b24073a504a19dbb3f5dabf377a8ea61ed",
      "context": "Web View > Web view on the server vs. Electron",
      "contextHash": "5e92a245e53850dc979156f10ba037f83321219d4b9e9bf4d58dd00f3b3a3525",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_721495897a620587bb5935d0_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "More specifically, quite a few websites oppose being embedded in another website (technically they have a non-permisive __TRILIUM_PH_0__ header). This is not bypassable by Trilium so the page will simply fail to render.",
      "sourceHash": "721495897a620587bb5935d0495869e5c10e67c09e9e48dc969b839138322c60",
      "context": "Web View > Web view on the server vs. Electron",
      "contextHash": "5e92a245e53850dc979156f10ba037f83321219d4b9e9bf4d58dd00f3b3a3525",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_58aa96d400e5e95245d3624f_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "You can diagnose this by right clicking the Trilium web page → Inspect (element) and looking in the “Console” tab for errors such as:",
      "sourceHash": "58aa96d400e5e95245d3624f376911400a3cb4dbcbf80f9448597319d8a4e114",
      "context": "Web View > Web view on the server vs. Electron",
      "contextHash": "5e92a245e53850dc979156f10ba037f83321219d4b9e9bf4d58dd00f3b3a3525",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_6cdc9e1eeed5605a51ed690c_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "There are a few websites that do render such as __TRILIUM_PH_0__.",
      "sourceHash": "6cdc9e1eeed5605a51ed690c7c9a74575b2595349041a3c512ce91de68c0c433",
      "context": "Web View > Web view on the server vs. Electron",
      "contextHash": "5e92a245e53850dc979156f10ba037f83321219d4b9e9bf4d58dd00f3b3a3525",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_1f7f9a9bdd2fa6f1c1cdd069_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Do note that we are also applying some sandboxing constraints on the server side, so if you have any issues other than the unresolvable __TRILIUM_PH_0__ described above, feel free to report them.",
      "sourceHash": "1f7f9a9bdd2fa6f1c1cdd0696fc2b80db4fdf521cf2b7da5d63afd4ec5fce212",
      "context": "Web View > Web view on the server vs. Electron",
      "contextHash": "5e92a245e53850dc979156f10ba037f83321219d4b9e9bf4d58dd00f3b3a3525",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_1a39226f39d741e840b4d3fb_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "On the desktop side, a different technology is used which bypasses the constraints of an __TRILIUM_PH_0__ (__TRILIUM_PH_1__).",
      "sourceHash": "1a39226f39d741e840b4d3fb70dbf538826579df75db44a888d5d7a079e51a1f",
      "context": "Web View > Web view on the server vs. Electron",
      "contextHash": "5e92a245e53850dc979156f10ba037f83321219d4b9e9bf4d58dd00f3b3a3525",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
